  "caveats": [
    "City coverage is partial. The source states: 'City is determined by address as reported by vehicle owner. Only select cities are included.' City counts do NOT sum to the state total.",
    "The 2020 vocabulary break is a real discontinuity. 'Converted' and 'Flexible' vanish after 2019 and were most likely folded into Gasoline. Annotate this in any time-series chart rather than smoothing it.",
    "Hybrid/electric/CNG counts are only as accurate as manufacturer-provided data. Converted/Propane counts are only as accurate as owner-reported data.",
    "'Passenger - Low Speed' vehicle type disappears from 2023 onward.",
    "HEBER city is absent in 2025 (not renamed \u2014 no replacement row exists).",
    "These are registration snapshots (active as of ~mid-February each year), not new-registration flows. Year-over-year deltas are net fleet change."
  ]
}